msgid "Orbital merging"
msgstr "轨道合并"

msgid "The merge program is called using"
msgstr "合并程序通过以下方式调用"

msgid "Defining the input orbitals (ORBITAL)"
msgstr "定义输入轨道 (ORBITAL)"

msgid ""
"Reads an input orbital set from a dump record. *specifications* can be used "
"to select specific orbital sets, as described in section `selecting orbitals"
" and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__. Subsets of these orbitals can be added to the output "
"set by the ``ADD``, ``MOVE``, or ``EXTRA`` commands."
msgstr ""
"从转储记录中读取一个输入轨道集。\\ *specifications* 可用于选择特定的轨道集，如章节 `选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, "
"DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-"
"matrices-orbital-density>`__ 所述。这些轨道的子集可以通过 ``ADD``\\ 、\\ ``MOVE`` 或 "
"``EXTRA`` 命令添加到输出集中。"

msgid "Moving orbitals to the output set (MOVE)"
msgstr "将轨道移至输出集（MOVE）"

msgid ""
"Orbitals from the input set which have already been moved or added to the "
"output set are generally skipped. If *orb1* and *orb2* are zero, the whole "
"input set is moved to the output set. In this case the input and output "
"dimensions must be identical. If *orb1* is nonzero but *orb2* is zero, "
"*orb2* is set to the last orbital in symmetry *sym2*. If *sym2=0*, *sym2* is"
" set to *sym1*. *ioff* is an offset in the output vector, relative to the "
"global offset set by ``OFFSET`` directive. *fac* has no effect for move. The"
" elements  *istart* to *iend* of the input vector are moved. If *istart=0* "
"and *iend=0*, the whole input vector is moved."
msgstr ""
"输入集中已移动或添加到输出集的轨道通常会被跳过。如果 *orb1* 和 *orb2* 均为零，则整个输入集被移至输出集。此时输入和输出维度必须相同。如果"
" *orb1* 非零但 *orb2* 为零，则 *orb2* 被设置为对称性 *sym2* 中的最后一个轨道。如果 *sym2=0*\\ ，则 "
"*sym2* 被设置为 *sym1*\\ 。\\ *ioff* 是输出向量中的一个偏移量，相对于 ``OFFSET`` 指令设置的全局偏移量。\\ "
"*fac* 对移动操作无效。输入向量的第 *istart* 到 *iend* 个元素被移动。如果 *istart=0* 且 *iend=0*\\ "
"，则移动整个输入向量。"

msgid ""
"The usage of the ``MOVE`` directive is most easily understood by looking at "
"the examples given below. See also ``ADD`` and ``EXTRA`` commands."
msgstr "通过查看下面给出的示例，最容易理解 ``MOVE`` 指令的用法。另请参阅 ``ADD`` 和 ``EXTRA`` 命令。"

msgid "Adding or replacing orbitals in the output set (ADD,REPLACE)"
msgstr "在输出集中添加或替换轨道（ADD,REPLACE）"

msgid ""
"This adds orbitals *orb1.sym1* to *orb2.sym2* to the output vectors, "
"starting at *orb3.sym3*. The input vectors are scaled by the factor *fac*. "
"If *fac=0*, *fac* is set to 1.0. For other details see ``MOVE`` command. "
"Note, however, that the output vectors which have already been defined are "
"not skipped as for ``MOVE``."
msgstr ""
"这将轨道 *orb1.sym1* 到 *orb2.sym2* 添加到输出向量中，从 *orb3.sym3* 开始。输入向量按因子 *fac* 缩放。如果"
" *fac=0*\\ ，则 *fac* 设置为 1.0。其他细节请参阅 ``MOVE`` 命令。但请注意，与 ``MOVE`` "
"不同，已定义的输出向量不会被跳过。"

msgid ""
"``REPLACE``,\\ *orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,,iustart,iend* Replaces "
"orbitals in the outputs set. If the output orbitals already exists, they are"
" set to zero and then replaced by the given input orbitals. Otherwise as "
"``ADD``."
msgstr ""
"``REPLACE``,\\ *orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,,iustart,iend* "
"替换输出集中的轨道。如果输出轨道已存在，则先将其设为零，然后用给定的输入轨道替换。其他方面与 ``ADD`` 相同。"

msgid "See also ``MOVE`` and ``EXTRA`` commands."
msgstr "另请参阅 ``MOVE`` 和 ``EXTRA`` 命令。"

msgid "Defining extra symmetries (EXTRA)"
msgstr "定义额外对称性 (EXTRA)"

msgid ""
"Works exactly as ``MOVE``, but only input vectors with extra symmetry "
"*exsym* are considered. If *orb1.sym1* and *orb2.sym2* are zero, all input "
"vectors are moved to the output set ordered according to increasing extra "
"symmetries."
msgstr ""
"工作方式与 ``MOVE`` 完全相同，但只考虑具有额外对称性 *exsym* 的输入向量。如果 *orb1.sym1* 和 *orb2.sym2* "
"为零，则所有输入向量都将被移动到输出集中，并按照额外对称性递增的顺序排列。"

msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid ""
"``EXTRA,1,-4.1`` will move the next 4 orbitals in symmetry 1 which have "
"extra symmetry 1. Orbitals which have been moved before are skipped."
msgstr "``EXTRA,1,-4.1`` 将移动对称性 1 中接下来 4 个具有额外对称性 1 的轨道。之前已移动过的轨道将被跳过。"

msgid ""
"``EXTRA,2,1.1`` will move all orbitals of symmetry 1 which have extra "
"symmetry 2. Orbitals which have been moved before are skipped."
msgstr "``EXTRA,2,1.1`` 将移动对称性 1 中所有具有额外对称性 2 的轨道。之前已移动过的轨道将被跳过。"

msgid ""
"``EXTRA`` will move all orbitals (all symmetries) and order them according "
"to extra symmetries."
msgstr "``EXTRA`` 将移动所有轨道（所有对称性）并根据额外对称性对它们进行排序。"

msgid ""
"``EXTRA,3,1.1,0.8`` Will move all orbitals which have extra symmetry 3 in "
"all symmetries. Orbitals which have been moved before are skipped."
msgstr "``EXTRA,3,1.1,0.8`` 将移动所有对称性中具有额外对称性 3 的所有轨道。之前已移动过的轨道将被跳过。"

msgid "See also ``ADD`` and ``MOVE`` commands."
msgstr "另请参阅 ``ADD`` 和 ``MOVE`` 命令。"

msgid "Defining offsets in the output set (OFFSET)"
msgstr "定义输出集中的偏移量 (OFFSET)"

msgid ""
"If the dimensions of the input orbital sets are smaller than the current "
"basis dimension, the offsets are determined automatically in the following "
"way: each time an orbital set is read in, the previous input orbital "
"dimensions are added to the offsets. Hence, this works correctly if the "
"orbital sets are given in the correct order and if the individual dimensions"
" add up to the current total dimension. If this is not the case, the offsets"
" should be specified on an ``OFFSET`` card which must follow the orbital "
"directive."
msgstr ""
"如果输入轨道集的维度小于当前基组维度，偏移量将按以下方式自动确定：每次读入一个轨道集时，之前的输入轨道维度会被加到偏移量上。因此，如果轨道集以正确的顺序给出，并且各个维度之和等于当前总维度，则此方法有效。如果不是这种情况，则应在"
" ``OFFSET`` 卡片上指定偏移量，该卡片必须跟在轨道指令之后。"

msgid "Projecting orbitals (PROJECT)"
msgstr "投影轨道 (PROJECT)"

msgid ""
"This command will read vectors from record *namin.file*. These vectors must "
"have the same dimension as those of the current calculation. All orbitals "
"defined so far by the ``ORBITAL``, ``MOVE``, and ``ADD`` directives are "
"projected out of the input set. The projected orbitals are then "
"orthonormalized and moved to the undefined output vectors. This should "
"always yield a complete set of vectors."
msgstr ""
"该命令将从记录 *namin.file* 中读取向量。这些向量必须与当前计算的维度相同。所有迄今为止由 ``ORBITAL``\\ 、\\ "
"``MOVE`` 和 ``ADD`` "
"指令定义的轨道都将从输入集中投影出去。然后，投影轨道被正交归一化并移动到未定义的输出向量中。这应始终产生一组完整的向量。"

msgid "Symmetric orthonormalization (ORTH)"
msgstr "对称正交归一化 (ORTH)"

msgid ""
"Symmetrically orthonormalizes the first :math:`n_i` vectors in each symmetry"
" :math:`i`. These vectors must be supplied before by ``ORBITAL`` and "
"``MOVE`` or ``ADD`` directives."
msgstr ""
"对每个对称性 :math:`i` 中的前 :math:`n_i` 个向量进行对称正交归一化。这些向量必须事先由 ``ORBITAL`` 和 "
"``MOVE`` 或 ``ADD`` 指令提供。"

msgid "Schmidt orthonormalization (SCHMIDT)"
msgstr "施密特正交归一化 (SCHMIDT)"

msgid ""
"Schmidt orthonormalizes the first :math:`n_i` vectors in each symmetry "
":math:`i`. These vectors must be supplied before by ``ORBITAL`` and ``MOVE``"
" or ``ADD`` directives."
msgstr ""
"对每个对称性 :math:`i` 中的前 :math:`n_i` 个向量进行施密特正交归一化。这些向量必须事先由 ``ORBITAL`` 和 "
"``MOVE`` 或 ``ADD`` 指令提供。"

msgid "Rotating orbitals (ROTATE)"
msgstr "轨道旋转（ROTATE）"

msgid ""
"Will perform :math:`2 \\times 2` rotation of orbitals *iorb1* and *iorb2* in"
" symmetry *sym* by the specified *angle* (in degree). *angle=0* means to "
"swap the orbitals (equivalent to *angle=90*) These vectors must be supplied "
"before by ``ORBITAL`` and ``MOVE`` or ``ADD`` directives."
msgstr ""
"将对对称性 *sym* 中的轨道 *iorb1* 和 *iorb2* 执行 :math:`2 \\times 2` 旋转，旋转角度为指定的 "
"*angle*\\ （以度为单位）。\\ *angle=0* 表示交换轨道（等同于 *angle=90*\\ ）。这些向量必须事先通过 "
"``ORBITAL`` 和 ``MOVE`` 或 ``ADD`` 指令提供。"

msgid "Initialization of a new output set (INIT)"
msgstr "初始化新的输出集（INIT）"

msgid ""
"Will initialize a new output set. All previous vectors in the output set are"
" lost unless they have been saved by a ``SAVE`` directive!"
msgstr "将初始化一个新的输出集。输出集中所有先前的向量都将丢失，除非它们已通过 ``SAVE`` 指令保存！"

msgid "Saving the merged orbitals"
msgstr "保存合并后的轨道"

msgid ""
"Saves the current output set to record *namout.file*. The current output set"
" must be complete and will be Schmidt orthonormalized before it is saved. If"
" the ``SAVE`` directive is not supplied, the output vectors will be saved "
"after all valid commands have been processed to the record specified on the "
"``MERGE`` card."
msgstr ""
"将当前输出集保存到记录 *namout.file* 中。当前输出集必须是完整的，并且在保存之前会进行施密特正交归一化。如果未提供 ``SAVE`` "
"指令，则在处理完所有有效命令后，输出向量将被保存到 ``MERGE`` 卡片上指定的记录中。"

msgid "Printing options (PRINT)"
msgstr "打印选项 (PRINT)"

msgid "Specifies print options."
msgstr "指定打印选项。"

msgid ""
"**:math:`iprint \\ge 1`:** orthonormalized orbitals specified on ``ORTH`` "
"card are printed."
msgstr "**:math:`iprint \\ge 1`:** 打印 ``ORTH`` 卡片上指定的正交归一化轨道。"

msgid ""
"**:math:`iprint \\ge 2`:** orbitals are also printed before this "
"orthonormalization."
msgstr "**:math:`iprint \\ge 2`:** 在此正交归一化之前也打印轨道。"

msgid "**:math:`iprint \\ge 3`:** all final vectors are printed."
msgstr "**:math:`iprint \\ge 3`:** 打印所有最终向量。"

msgid ""
"**:math:`ideb \\ne 0`:** the overlap matrices are printed at various stages."
msgstr "**:math:`ideb \\ne 0`:** 在各个阶段打印重叠矩阵。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "H2F"
msgstr "H2F"

msgid "This example merges the orbitals of H\\ :math:`_2` and F"
msgstr "此示例合并了 H\\ :math:`_2` 和 F 的轨道。"

msgid "NO"
msgstr "NO"

msgid ""
"This example merges the SCF orbitals of N and O to get a full valence space "
"for NO. In the simplest case the atomic calculations are performed in the "
"individual separate basis sets, but using the same symmetry (C\\ "
":math:`_{2v}`) as the molecular calculation."
msgstr ""
"此示例合并了 N 和 O 的 SCF 轨道，以获得 NO "
"的完整价空间。在最简单的情况下，原子计算在各自独立的基组中进行，但使用与分子计算相同的对称性（C\\ :math:`_{2v}`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"One can also do the atomic calculations in the total basis set, using dummy "
"cards. In this case the procedure is more complicated, since the union of "
"the two orbital spaces is over-complete. The calculation can be done as "
"follows:"
msgstr "也可以在总基组中进行原子计算，使用虚拟基组卡。在这种情况下，过程更为复杂，因为两个轨道空间的并集是过完备的。计算可以按如下方式进行："

msgid "SCF for the total molecule, orbitals saved to 2100.2"
msgstr "总分子的 SCF，轨道保存至 2100.2"

msgid ""
"Orbitals can be manipulated using the ``MERGE`` facility. For instance, this"
" allows the construction of molecular orbitals from atomic orbitals, to "
"merge and orthogonalize different orbital sets, or to perform :math:`2 "
"\\times 2` rotations between individual orbitals. Other orbital "
"manipulations can be performed using the ``LOCALI`` program (see section "
":doc:`orbital localization <orbital_localization>`) or the ``MATROP`` "
"program (section :doc:`matrix operations <matrix_operations>`)."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``MERGE`` 功能来操作轨道。例如，这允许从原子轨道构造分子轨道，合并并正交化不同的轨道集，或在单个轨道之间执行 :math:`2 "
"\\times 2` 旋转。其他轨道操作可以使用 ``LOCALI`` 程序（参见章节 :doc:`轨道定域化 "
"<orbital_localization>`\\ ）或 ``MATROP`` 程序（章节 :doc:`矩阵操作 "
"<matrix_operations>`\\ ）来执行。"

msgid "``MERGE [,namout.file]``"
msgstr "``MERGE [,namout.file]``"

msgid ""
"All subcommands described in the following sections may be abbreviated by "
"three characters. *namout.file* specifies the output data set (see also "
"``SAVE`` command). If *namout.file* is omitted and no ``SAVE`` card is "
"present, the new orbitals are not saved. All output orbitals must be "
"supplied via ``ORBITAL`` and ``ADD``, ``MOVE``, ``REPLACE``, ``EXTRA``, or "
"``PROJECT`` directives before they can be saved."
msgstr ""
"以下各节中描述的所有子命令均可缩写为三个字符。\\ *namout.file* 指定输出数据集（另见 ``SAVE`` 命令）。如果省略 "
"*namout.file* 且不存在 ``SAVE`` 卡片，则新轨道不会被保存。所有输出轨道必须在保存之前通过 ``ORBITAL`` 和 "
"``ADD``\\ 、\\ ``MOVE``\\ 、\\ ``REPLACE``\\ 、\\ ``EXTRA`` 或 ``PROJECT`` 指令提供。"

msgid "``ORBITAL,namin.file,specifications``"
msgstr "``ORBITAL,namin.file,specifications``"

msgid "``MOVE,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"
msgstr "``MOVE,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"

msgid ""
"Moves orbitals *orb1.sym1* to *orb2.sym2* from the input set to the first "
"vector of symmetry *sym3* in the output set which is undefined so far. The "
"first *orb3-1* vectors in the output set are skipped regardless of whether "
"they have been defined before or not. If *sym2 :math:`>` sym1*, *sym3* will "
"run from *sym1* to *sym2* and the input for *sym3* has no effect. If "
"*orb1.sym1* is negative, abs(*orb1*) is the maximum number of orbitals to be"
" moved, starting with orbital *1.sym1*, up to *orb2.sym2*. If *orb2.sym2* is"
" negative, abs(*orb2*) is the maximum number of vectors to be moved, "
"starting at *orb1.isym1* up to the last orbital in symmetry *sym2*."
msgstr ""
"将输入集中的轨道 *orb1.sym1* 至 *orb2.sym2* 移动到输出集中对称性 *sym3* 的第一个尚未定义的矢量处。输出集中的前 "
"*orb3-1* 个矢量将被跳过，无论它们之前是否已被定义。如果 *sym2 :math:`>` sym1*\\ ，则 *sym3* 将从 *sym1*"
" 运行到 *sym2*\\ ，并且 *sym3* 的输入无效。如果 *orb1.sym1* 为负，则 abs(*orb1*) "
"是要移动的最大轨道数，从轨道 *1.sym1* 开始，直到 *orb2.sym2*\\ 。如果 *orb2.sym2* 为负，则 abs(*orb2*)"
" 是要移动的最大矢量数，从 *orb1.isym1* 开始，直到对称性 *sym2* 中的最后一个轨道。"

msgid "``ADD,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"
msgstr "``ADD,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"

msgid "``EXTRA,exsym,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"
msgstr "``EXTRA,exsym,orb1.sym1,orb2.sym2,orb3.sym3,ioff,fac,istart,iend``"

msgid "``OFFSET,iof$_1$,iof$_2$,$\\ldots$,iof$_8$;``"
msgstr "``OFFSET,iof$_1$,iof$_2$,$\\ldots$,iof$_8$;``"

msgid ""
"Sets offsets in the output vector for symmetries 1 to 8. In subsequent "
"``MOVE`` or ``ADD`` commands, the input vectors are moved to the locations "
"*iof:math:`_i`+1* in the output vectors. The offset for individual ``ADD`` "
"or ``MOVE`` commands can be modified by the parameter *ioff* on these cards."
" This card should immediately follow the orbital directive to which it "
"applies. Generally, this card is only needed if the dimensions of input and "
"output vectors are not identical."
msgstr ""
"设置输出矢量中对称性 1 到 8 的偏移量。在随后的 ``MOVE`` 或 ``ADD`` 命令中，输入矢量被移动到输出矢量的位置 "
"*iof:math:`_i`+1* 处。各个 ``ADD`` 或 ``MOVE`` 命令的偏移量可以通过这些卡片上的参数 *ioff* "
"修改。此卡片应紧跟在它所适用的轨道指令之后。通常，仅当输入和输出矢量的维度不相同时才需要此卡片。"

msgid "``PROJECT,namin.file``"
msgstr "``PROJECT,namin.file``"

msgid "``ORTH,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"
msgstr "``ORTH,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"

msgid "``SCHMIDT,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"
msgstr "``SCHMIDT,$n_1,n_2,\\ldots,n_8$``"

msgid "``ROTATE,iorb1.sym,iorb2,angle``"
msgstr "``ROTATE,iorb1.sym,iorb2,angle``"

msgid "``INIT,namout.file``"
msgstr "``INIT,namout.file``"

msgid "``SAVE,namout.file``"
msgstr "``SAVE,namout.file``"

msgid "``PRINT,iprint,ideb``"
msgstr "``PRINT,iprint,ideb``"

msgid ":math:`iprint = 0` no print"
msgstr ":math:`iprint = 0` 不打印"

